{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00405","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00405@rel:R25-11#c4ec6e96","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00405","release":"R25-11","content":"function GetCurrentKeyValueStorageSize [SWS_PER_00405] Upstream: RS_PER_00017 , RS_AP_00119 , RS_AP_00120 , RS_AP_00121 , RS_AP_00127 , RS_AP_00128 , RS_AP_00129 , RS_AP_00135 , RS_AP_00137 , RS_AP_00139 , RS_AP_00159 ara::core::Result &lt; std::uint64_t &gt; GetCurrentKeyValueStorageSize (const ara::core::InstanceSpecifier &amp;kvs) noexcept; Returns the space in bytes currently occupied by a Key-Value Storage. The returned size includes all metadata and the space used for redundancy and backups. The returned size is only guaranteed to be accurate if the Key-Value Storage is not opened and no other operation on the Key-Value Storage takes place at the same time. Header-Datei #include \"ara/per/key_value_storage.h\" class mono Scope namespace ara::per class mono Exception-Sicherheit exception safe class mono Thread-Sicherheit thread-safe class mono Parameter (in) th Parameter th Beschreibung td kvs td The shortName path of a PortPrototype typed by a PersistencyKey ValueStorageInterface. Rückgabewert th Typ th Beschreibung td ara::core::Result &lt;std::uint64_t &gt; td A Result containing the occupied space in bytes. In case of an error, it contains any of the errors defined below, or a vendor specific error. Fehler th Fehlercode th Beschreibung td PerErrc ::kStorageNotFound td rollback_semantics Returned if the passed InstanceSpecifier does not match any PersistencyKeyValueStorageInterface configured for this Executable. td PerErrc ::kPhysicalStorageFailure td rollback_semantics Returned if access to the physical storage fails.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"baseline_sync"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:43:34+00:00","text_key":"d66ff5ff18aa"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00405","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R25-11","la